，输了就转移话题。", "subject": "ME", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [], "evidence_quotes": [], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed_seed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "kbin:style", "plan_status": "", "ts": "", "history": []}, "f_0005": {"fact_id": "f_0005", "text": "傅临川，组里腿最勤镜头最稳、被怼不急，赢了不抖、记性好，谁报过什么鸟都记得", "subject": "ME", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [], "evidence_quotes": [], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed_seed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "persona:me", "plan_status": "", "ts": "", "history": []}, "f_0006": {"fact_id": "f_0006", "text": "沈疏桐，观鸟记录对到小数点、好胜，认细节不认人、嘴硬，谢人不超过三个字，底线：公私分明，组务不掺私交、不收不明不白的好处", "subject": "HER", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [], "evidence_quotes": [], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed_seed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "persona:her", "plan_status": "", "ts": "", "history": []}, "f_0007": {"fact_id": "f_0007", "text": "我周六报的鸟名是'北红尾鸲'", "subject": "ME", "relation": "观鸟记录", "evidence_uids": [0], "evidence_quotes": ["你周六嘴里的那只'北红尾鸲'"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "周六", "valid_from": "2026-11-14 21:17", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-14 21:17", "history": []}, "f_0008": {"fact_id": "f_0008", "text": "她核对照片后认定该鸟为红胁蓝尾鸲，今年雄鸟冬羽", "subject": "HER", "relation": "观鸟记录纠错", "evidence_uids": [0], "evidence_quotes": ["我回去对着照片查了，是红胁蓝尾鸲，今年雄鸟的冬羽"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-14 21:17", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-14 21:17", "history": []}, "f_0009": {"fact_id": "f_0009", "text": "她已在记录中心标注，阿荞审核通过", "subject": "HER", "relation": "观鸟记录", "evidence_uids": [0], "evidence_quotes": ["记录中心我标了，阿荞审核也过了"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_tim